      "family_literature_context": "Web review 2026-05-08: CPOSS209 describes racemic ibuprofen Form I as the marketed and most stable racemic form at low temperature, and Form II as a second less-stable/highly metastable racemic form containing two conformations. The 2012 ibuprofen Form II paper shows Form II preparation from the supercooled liquid as high as 273 K. This supports IBP family curation but does not by itself map IBP06_PsiCrys to a specific experimental form.",
